    // standing vertically, the rectangle CE applied to it on one side
    // (breadth ED) and the rectangle CF (declared "EF") on the other
    // (breadth DF). The proof talks about the sides CD, ED, DF, so those are
    // transparent highlight targets (;0;0;0). The two rectangles have
    // random faces, so they are lit through faceless, strokeless twins
    // CEh / CFh (#140); prose and captions reach them with the display
    // override ({CE|CEh}, {EC|CEh}, {CF|CFh}). Resting figure unchanged.
    //
